  "instructions": [
    "In a blender, combine plum tomatoes, ginger, fermented soybeans, fish sauce, sambal oelek, hoisin sauce, brown sugar, pandan extract, salt, and black pepper to make the sauce.",
    "Heat 2 tablespoons of oil in a pan over medium-high heat.",
    "Add the ground pork and cook until browned, breaking it up with a spoon as it cooks.",
    "Add the onions and cook until they are translucent.",
    "Pour the sauce into the pan and stir to combine.",
    "Simmer the sauce for 10 minutes, or until it has thickened.",
    "Cut the pandan leaves into 8 equal pieces and place a few tablespoons of the pork and sauce mixture onto the center of each leaf.",
    "Fold the leaves into a neat package and serve immediately."
